action:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: transparent eight-frame sprite sheet for CANCEL CITY's FREEZER CC012. Image1 is the authoritative CURRENT CARD STYLE and identity. Image2 only explains the full-body anatomy, teal apron and small chest-freezer prop construction; do not copy its overly clean rendering.
Exactly EIGHT intact full-body character-and-freezer tableaux on a genuinely transparent canvas, FOUR COLUMNS by TWO ROWS. Equal spacious cells with clear gutters, nothing cut off. Consistent medium-wide 3/4 viewpoint facing screen-right and same scale. Entire tail, feet and freezer visible.
IDENTITY: slim short imperious white alien frozen-food clerk, huge polished violet-purple dome on bald head, purple shoulder/forearm/shin plates, cruel red eyes, small pointed white face and cheek hatch marks, very long white reptile tail, teal-green supermarket apron tied at waist, small blank tan name badge. Same exact identity as card. Prop is one waist-high off-white rectangular chest freezer with bright cobalt-blue rim and hinged sliding curved glass lid. The clerk touches or hooks his tail round the freezer in every pose so actor+prop are one connected cutout. No text on prop.
STYLE: current card's dense harsh scratched-ink etching, crosshatching, stipple, imperfect grotesque smug expressions and lurid purple/teal/acid contrasts. The entire image should feel like gritty ugly ink printed on cheap paper. No polished anime cel style, clean vector, glossy3D or smooth painting.
Pose order left-to-right top then bottom:
1 imperious villain ready, folded arms, tail curls under freezer edge;
2 boastful raised index finger, smug red eyes, other hand resting on freezer rim;
3 powering up with clenched fist and snarling face, hand/tail touching freezer, NO aura drawn;
4 both hands grab lid and begin opening chest freezer;
5 one foot on freezer edge, climbing inside, tail hooked over rim;
6 both feet over rim, crouches descending into open freezer, one hand grips lid;
7 body nearly inside, head and shoulders above rim, arms braced;
8 peeks proudly over open freezer edge, tail curled around the rear lid hinge.
Each is ONE coherent complete connected character-and-prop drawing, no severed or floating body parts. No floor, cast shadow, scenery, aura, energy blast, projectile, fog or text. Background must be actually transparent.

ending:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: second transparent eight-frame animation sheet for FREEZER CC012, continuing the exact character AND off-white blue-rim chest-freezer prop from reference image2. Reference image1 defines dense scratchy etched printed card style.
LAYOUT: exactly EIGHT fully visible isolated character-in-freezer tableaux, FOUR COLUMNS by TWO ROWS on true alpha transparency. Clear generous empty gutters, consistent three-quarter camera facing screen-right, same prop scale. Each entire chest freezer and all visible head, arms and tail must stay within its cell, never touching next drawing.
IDENTITY LOCK: white alien grocery clerk with large glossy violet-purple bald head dome, purple round shoulder plates and forearms, cruel narrow red eyes, cheek hatching and tiny pointed smug face; teal-green apron and blank tan name badge; long white tail curled behind freezer. Same off-white rectangular chest freezer with cobalt-blue upper edge, hinged glass lid, lower front small black control panel and red/green status lights. Keep appearance EXACTLY consistent between frames.
Dense gritty black crosshatching, scratched etching, stippling, black shadows, lurid violet/teal and slightly grotesque expressive face. More handmade ink texture than polished animation. No clean vector, realistic3D, smooth glossy rendering.
Frame order left-to-right top then bottom:
1 in OPEN freezer chest up, one pointing commanding finger, face villainously boastful, forearm rests across edge;
2 still in open freezer, smug expression breaks into worried shiver, both hands clutch rim, shoulders raised;
3 shivers harder, clenched teeth, begins pulling hinged glass lid downward with one hand;
4 half-closes lid, crouches lower, astonished red eyes peering through remaining opening, all body naturally concealed by freezer;
5 emerges slightly and puts on a huge strained happy delivery-worker smile, both hands on rim, teal apron still visible;
6 lowers head and shoulders under nearly closed glass lid, annoyed eyes glaring through glass; tail mostly hidden;
7 lid fully closed, only the alien's big angry red eyes and purple dome faintly visible THROUGH frosty glass, the rest of the body inside the opaque freezer;
8 lid reopened a crack, head and hands peek out with hilariously offended side-eye, white tail curls behind the hinge.
Actor and freezer form ONE connected subject per cell. Visible arms/hands attached; concealed body parts are inside chest, no detached pieces or severed limbs. Small frost texture on glass only, no floating frost/snow/ice, no particle effects, fog, background, floor, cast shadow, lettering, labels, logos, card frame, watermark. Genuinely transparent outside eight cutouts.
